        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Traffic and housing problems could be solved by moving large companies, factories and their employees to the countryside. Do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5DBdsRrnozRWmxvqRilBEJHg2e\"><em><strong>Traffic and housing problems could be solved by moving large companies, factories and their employees to the countryside. Do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Relocating Companies to Solve Urban Issues&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong>&nbsp;</span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A099dRmIkoIZDzxw18ZlXs7dgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Relocating Companies to Solve Urban Issues&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> C&aacute;c vấn đề về giao th&ocirc;ng v&agrave; nh&agrave; ở c&oacute; thể được giải quyết bằng c&aacute;ch chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcpldBJgQoHt0wxXlCslhrqlg2g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCTPdxz4noAQ7OxwM7Mln6BkgHo\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Relocating Companies to Solve Urban Issues&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4tddQy3No346MxSPyzlhMF4gth\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IuA0dTVIyodA6sxc2selS9uigXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2uWdaRIboGYwoxJuvQl6l9lgFg\"><em>(*) Bạn học<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent</strong></span> </a>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ul6hdVxNqo1uhdx42LZlAbwRgte\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7i1dwljAoQwyvx8g4MlS426gwv\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>major employers<em>&nbsp;(c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp lớn)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZzndnlaHoVWC0xAFNwlGj0zgpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">rural districts&nbsp;<em>(c&aacute;c v&ugrave;ng n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZzndnlaHoVWC0xAFNwlGj0zgpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">workforces<em> (lực lượng lao động)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KU7ddXdoXopLr1xa8oilkZQVg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXw8d8W27oJqPhxwglalEdS6g2e\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm <strong>'đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'việc giải quyết c&aacute;c vấn đề về giao th&ocirc;ng v&agrave; nh&agrave; ở bằng c&aacute;ch chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n mang lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch hơn nếu được thi h&agrave;nh đ&uacute;ng c&aacute;ch'.</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwQLdYMpuov5WExi9RRl4IaMgff\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của&nbsp;<strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BRlddRkjmo6c2sx9HhklQ7XYgIO\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BARcd0bfioqHhNxlqRrlumo2gVe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số bất lợi của việc chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AdEjdtllIomd9Zx2rSxlw7Iug6q\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n đem lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số bất lợi của việc chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NqnSdKcbboevQ4xte8tlDTykguM\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYL1d9ZGfonTvexCM4Clkm1kgrb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc <em data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"68\">di dời c&aacute;c nh&agrave; tuyển dụng lớn</em> (<em data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"98\">relocating major employers</em>) c&oacute; thể <em data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"123\" data-is-only-node=\"\">kh&ocirc;ng hiệu quả</em> (<em data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"144\">prove ineffective</em>) nếu c&aacute;c rủi ro từ <em data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"202\">cơ sở hạ tầng n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n kh&ocirc;ng đầy đủ</em> (<em data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"237\">inadequate rural infrastructure</em>) v&agrave; <em data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"271\">l&agrave;n s&oacute;ng đi l&agrave;m ngược chiều</em> (<em data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"292\">reverse commuting</em>) kh&ocirc;ng được giải quyết.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SIsCds3H6oV1qzx25KPlMB0fg4d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RENpdJeTgoeIaOxgZt2ladQSgBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Trước hết, nhiều <em data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"354\">địa phương tiếp nhận tiềm năng</em> (<em data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"387\">potential recipient districts</em>) c&oacute; <em data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"427\">hạ tầng c&ocirc;ng cộng chưa ph&aacute;t triển</em> (<em data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"467\">underdeveloped public infrastructure</em>) để xử l&yacute; <em data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"513\">lưu lượng giao th&ocirc;ng giờ cao điểm</em> (<em data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"542\">peak-hour traffic volumes</em>).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvwgdtDlto74VNxuQlClUiYsgpg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Do đ&oacute;, <em data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"596\">cơ quan chức năng</em> (<em data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"611\">authorities</em>) cần khẩn trương thực hiện <em data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"663\">đầu tư ban đầu đ&aacute;ng kể</em> (<em data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"698\" data-is-only-node=\"\">substantial upfront investments</em>) để <em data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"727\">n&acirc;ng cấp cơ sở hiện c&oacute;</em> (<em data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"759\">upgrading current facilities</em>), nhằm hiện thực ho&aacute; c&aacute;c&nbsp;<em data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"803\">lợi &iacute;ch về giao th&ocirc;ng v&agrave; nh&agrave; ở</em> (<em data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"835\">traffic and housing benefits</em>).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IfvqdufkJo24lNxElITlPkoxgMf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AiWrdbByBoLkcwxIzZFlnqIngte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, <em data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"975\">đi l&agrave;m ngược chiều</em> (<em data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"996\">reverse commuting</em>) c&oacute; thể xảy ra khi một bộ phận <em data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1055\">lực lượng lao động di dời</em> (<em data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1079\">relocating workforce</em>) chọn ở lại <em data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1110\">trung t&acirc;m đ&ocirc; thị</em> (<em data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1127\">urban centres</em>) v&igrave; <em data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1151\">r&agrave;ng buộc c&aacute; nh&acirc;n</em> (<em data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1175\">personal commitments</em>), như <em data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1204\">gi&aacute;o dục của con c&aacute;i</em> (<em data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1228\">children&rsquo;s education</em>) hoặc <em data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1254\">sở th&iacute;ch lối sống</em> (<em data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1279\">lifestyle preferences</em>), dẫn đến <em data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1325\">c&aacute;c lượt đi lại hai chiều k&eacute;o d&agrave;i</em> (<em data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1360\">extended bidirectional commutes</em>) trong giờ cao điểm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WtS5dyJMWo3BPgxs7uwlDO67gfe\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1397\">Impact:</strong> Hệ quả l&agrave; điều n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng chỉ lấn &aacute;t đi <em data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1455\">c&aacute;c lợi &iacute;ch kỳ vọng</em> (<em data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1491\">negates the anticipated benefits</em>) về <em data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1518\">tắc nghẽn giao th&ocirc;ng</em> (<em data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1540\" data-is-only-node=\"\">traffic congestion</em>) m&agrave; c&ograve;n<em> đẩy mạnh nhu cầu cao </em>(<em data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1594\">sustains high demand</em>) đối với <em data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1625\">nh&agrave; ở khu trung t&acirc;m</em> (<em data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1644\">central housing</em>).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc chuyển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn, nh&agrave; m&aacute;y v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n của họ ra n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n mang lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IdgQdvWwFoRLblxjbevlYW1Zg8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShY5diK9xoVDvzxEX6IlnvwSgCf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, khi <em>được triển khai một c&aacute;ch c&oacute; chiến lược (strategically implemented)</em>, t&ocirc;i tin rằng ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch n&agrave;y&nbsp;sẽ mang lại nhiều lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yh4GdZsk6o5dLux4TDclFWBQgJh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZYOYdZ0TeoaeldxfqPRlfW0NgEf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Về <em data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"281\">t&iacute;nh cơ động giao th&ocirc;ng</em> (<em data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"293\">mobility</em>), <em data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"331\" data-is-only-node=\"\">di dời c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m việc l&agrave;m lớn</em> (<em data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"367\">relocating major employment hubs</em>) đến <em data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"390\">c&aacute;c khu vệ tinh</em> (<em data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"409\">satellite zones</em>) gi&uacute;p <em data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"449\">giảm đ&aacute;ng kể lượng người đi lại</em> (<em data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"484\">reduces the volume of commuters</em>) dồn về <em data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"532\">một khu trung t&acirc;m thương mại duy nhất</em> (<em data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"570\">a single central business district</em>).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CJyUd5se5oAaYIxyXYtlzMXDggd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact:</strong> Hệ quả trực tiếp<span data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"610\"> l&agrave; </span><em data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"676\">tải đỉnh (peak loads) tr&ecirc;n mạng lưới giao th&ocirc;ng</em>&nbsp;được <em data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"744\">ph&acirc;n bổ đồng đều hơn</em> (<em data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"771\">distributed more evenly</em>), <em data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"782\">&ugrave;n tắc</em> (<em data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"796\">congestion</em>) dọc c&aacute;c <em data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"823\">h&agrave;nh lang ch&iacute;nh</em> (<em data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"842\">major corridors</em>) <em data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"854\">giảm bớt</em> (<em data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"864\">easing</em>) v&agrave; <em data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"910\">thời gian di chuyển trung b&igrave;nh r&uacute;t ngắn</em> (<em data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"943\">average travel time shortened</em>).</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8RLdNkOmoTpmvxFDUWlyJ03gTc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rkg6d07MCoJB8HxQdqRlhAmsguL\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1009\">sự ph&acirc;n t&aacute;n việc l&agrave;m</em> (<em data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1034\">employment dispersion</em>) n&agrave;y <em data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1058\" data-is-only-node=\"\">l&agrave;m giảm nhu cầu</em> (<em data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1083\">diminishes the demand</em>) của người lao động <em data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1132\">phải cư tr&uacute; gần l&otilde;i đ&ocirc; thị</em> (<em data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1164\">to reside near the city core</em>).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTOKdoxxZoiBrbxyWETlXQTagig\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact:</strong> Từ đ&oacute;, <em data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1228\">cạnh tranh về chỗ ở</em> (<em data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1261\">competition for accommodation</em>) ở&nbsp;<em data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1284\">c&aacute;c khu trung t&acirc;m</em> (<em data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1310\">central neighbourhoods</em>) <em data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1322\">hạ nhiệt</em> (<em data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1335\">subsiding</em>). <em data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1350\">Về d&agrave;i hạn</em> (<em data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1369\">In the long run</em>), chiến lược n&agrave;y&nbsp;c&oacute; thể <em data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1440\">ổn định chi ph&iacute; thu&ecirc; nh&agrave;</em> (<em data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1473\">stabilise house renting costs</em>) v&agrave; <em data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\">cải thiện cơ hội t&igrave;m được nơi ở ưa th&iacute;ch</em> (<em data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1586\">improve the prospects of securing preferable residing location</em>) cho từng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VfQ3d5yCDoJva6xFyAmlDvTug7D\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZhsXdSzLJo1HJZxctqalcRhzgXf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gup4deb3eo7dZFxQEtBlKUpng6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VaDXdwkz6oK74GxbJStlRk1Dg4d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UWfpdfFcaoI6NFxUGyilcSGLgRe\">\n<p>decentralisation of major employers&nbsp;<em>(ph&acirc;n t&aacute;n c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m việc l&agrave;m lớn)</em></p>\n<p>alleviate urban congestion and housing pressures&nbsp;<em>(giảm &ugrave;n tắc giao th&ocirc;ng v&agrave; &aacute;p lực nh&agrave; ở th&agrave;nh thị)</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1608,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wqn1dX8IHoeh8yxy0yqlVqJLgCh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKpEdRLTroQKRmxhpjDly9lzgEb\">Opinions are divided on whether shifting major employers and their workforces to rural districts would solve problems of traffic and accommodation in cities. While this policy is far from risk-free, I contend its benefits outweigh the drawbacks when implemented selectively and with careful planning.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18132,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1609,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuwOdN5tKoF0HVxREaBlFy8cgVf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZqZdJlCFokU3LxRXiRlQ6b2g1e\"><strong>Admittedly, relocating major employers can prove ineffective if risks from inadequate rural infrastructure and reverse commuting are not addressed.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">To begin with, many potential recipient districts have underdeveloped public infrastructure to handle peak-hour traffic volumes. As a result, it is urgent for authorities to make substantial upfront investments in upgrading current facilities in order for any traffic and housing benefits to be realistically anticipated.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, reverse commuting could occur when a portion of the relocating workforce chooses to remain in urban centres due to personal commitments, such as children's education, or lifestyle preferences, which leads to the extended bidirectional commutes during peak hours. Consequently, this not only negates the anticipated benefits for traffic congestion but also sustains high demand for central housing.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18132,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1610,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YuLDdi9uHo6lEkx5VCmlxkUegrf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6KqdMUZyo6d5dxGxMslTQj6gme\"><strong>However, when strategically implemented, I believe this policy will yield more substantial advantages.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Regarding mobility, relocating major employment hubs to satellite zones significantly reduces the volume of commuters on a single central business district.<strong> </strong>As a direct consequence, peak loads on the transport network are distributed more evenly with congestion along major corridors easing and average travel time shortened. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">In addition, such employment dispersion diminishes the demand for workers to reside near the city core, thereby leading to subsiding competition for accommodation in central neighbourhoods. In the long run, this strategy can help stabilise house renting costs and improve the prospects of securing preferable residing location for individuals.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18132,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1611,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxvhdzL5Ro103CxZ0WHlUcVTgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UWfpdfFcaoI6NFxUGyilcSGLgRe\">In conclusion, although the decentralisation of major employers presents notable challenges, I believe that it remains a viable strategy for alleviating urban congestion and housing pressures. However, the success of such initiatives significantly relies on proactive government investment and strategic planning to mitigate the negative impacts of reverse commuting.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18132,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
